{"name": "Castaway Trails", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a party of unique survivors and guide them through a procedurally generated world where friendships, romances, rivalries, and betrayals emerge naturally.<strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vast, ever-changing world filled with medieval ruins, hostile creatures, and meaningful encounters. Form a party of unique characters, each with their own personality, needs, and moral compass.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/27f5d5a5200a6f7a9758500aed2164f4.poster.avif?t=1784793668\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/27f5d5a5200a6f7a9758500aed2164f4.webm?t=1784793668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/27f5d5a5200a6f7a9758500aed2164f4.mp4?t=1784793668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During travels between locations, your companions will talk, argue, bond\u2026 or even betray each other. Their relationships evolve dynamically \u2014 friendships, rivalries, romances\u2026 or irreparable feuds may emerge.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/f78a1a987ff7d0b53238661b1e8450ca.poster.avif?t=1784793668\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/f78a1a987ff7d0b53238661b1e8450ca.webm?t=1784793668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/f78a1a987ff7d0b53238661b1e8450ca.mp4?t=1784793668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your resources carefully: food, rest, and shelter are key to survival. Engage in turn-based combat with tactical depth, make choices that shape the story, and lead your party through an adventure where no two playthroughs are the same.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/2ecd71f53ac3b95d0a94edf1d57af1ec.poster.avif?t=1784793668\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/2ecd71f53ac3b95d0a94edf1d57af1ec.webm?t=1784793668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/2ecd71f53ac3b95d0a94edf1d57af1ec.mp4?t=1784793668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic relationships between companions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/57f8ab30666f646b42fd2f1bd7bb270a.poster.avif?t=1784793668\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/57f8ab30666f646b42fd2f1bd7bb270a.webm?t=1784793668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/57f8ab30666f646b42fd2f1bd7bb270a.mp4?t=1784793668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Friendships, romances, rivalries, and betrayals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/6c8a08c06cead74f76c4159b2797c03c.poster.avif?t=1784793668\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/6c8a08c06cead74f76c4159b2797c03c.webm?t=1784793668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/6c8a08c06cead74f76c4159b2797c03c.mp4?t=1784793668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated adventures<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/2e812c3f96d696b413910f630fb7828b.poster.avif?t=1784793668\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/2e812c3f96d696b413910f630fb7828b.webm?t=1784793668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/2e812c3f96d696b413910f630fb7828b.mp4?t=1784793668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit unique characters with distinct personalities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/8d1378907c2c5e4e18c6f2b1f5be609b.poster.avif?t=1784793668\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/8d1378907c2c5e4e18c6f2b1f5be609b.webm?t=1784793668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/8d1378907c2c5e4e18c6f2b1f5be609b.mp4?t=1784793668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tactical turn-based combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/61002d1fef113b9ebd49dfb3822ee3d4.poster.avif?t=1784793668\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/61002d1fef113b9ebd49dfb3822ee3d4.webm?t=1784793668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/61002d1fef113b9ebd49dfb3822ee3d4.mp4?t=1784793668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Camp management, crafting, cooking, fishing, and survival</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/a7eb0116aeef23eecf96cb77237c12bb.poster.avif?t=1784793668\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/a7eb0116aeef23eecf96cb77237c12bb.webm?t=1784793668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/a7eb0116aeef23eecf96cb77237c12bb.mp4?t=1784793668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a changing world full of quests and discoveries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/18d1b2b3e7e49413bdc5e9db256589b8.poster.avif?t=1784793668\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/18d1b2b3e7e49413bdc5e9db256589b8.webm?t=1784793668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/18d1b2b3e7e49413bdc5e9db256589b8.mp4?t=1784793668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Will they stay together\u2026 or fall apart when they\u2019re needed the most?</strong></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Recruit companions, survive together, and watch friendships, romances, and rivalries emerge. No two adventures are the same.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/51d555e376c2583a98687c2ff4012186e19658f0/header.jpg?t=1784793668", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Party-Based RPG", "Exploration", "Turn-Based Combat", "RPG", "Sandbox", "Choose Your Own Adventure"], "developers": "Edudelm", "publishers": "Edudelm", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3883020", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "24 June 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/EryNSTuyFZs", "first_seen": 1782252000.0, "review_rank": 366}